      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：我最喜欢的汉语是“都可以”。",
      "traditional": "本：我最喜歡的漢語是“都可以”。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ zuì xǐ huan de hàn yǔ shì dōu kě yǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "人们问我你喜欢什么的时候，我不知道怎么说，我就可以说，“都可以”。",
      "traditional": "人們問我你喜歡什麼的時候，我不知道怎麼說，我就可以說，“都可以”。",
      "pinyin": "rén men wèn wǒ nǐ xǐ huan shén me de shí hou wǒ bù zhī dào zěn me shuō wǒ jiù kě yǐ shuō dōu kě yǐ",
      "english": "Ben: My favorite Chinese word is “It’s all OK.”."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When people ask me what I like, and I don’t know what to say, then I can say “It’s all OK”."
    }
